    30	      C ${s(-0.2)} ${s(0.1)} ${s(-0.36)} ${s(0.2)} ${s(-0.48)} ${s(0.4)} C ${s(-0.44)} ${s(0.04)} ${s(-0.22)} ${s(-0.18)} ${s(0.08)} ${s(-0.2)} Z"
