    35	    C ${s(0.03)} ${s(-0.39)} ${s(0.12)} ${s(-0.46)} ${s(0.24)} ${s(-0.46)} C ${s(0.36)} ${s(-0.46)} ${s(0.5)} ${s(-0.36)} ${s(0.5)} ${s(-0.18)}
